IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. HelloWorld.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    CASE 4 OF
        0: SAY "Sunday";     |
        1: SAY "Monday";     |
        2: SAY "Tuesday";    |
        3: SAY "Wednesday";  |
        4: SAY "Thursday";   |
        5: SAY "Friday";     |
      6,7: SAY "Saturday";   |
    ELSE SAY "Unknown";
    END

END PROGRAM.
